1
00:00:00,494 --> 00:00:03,394
(Sheldon:)So I guess there's two things
I can't tell you.

2
00:00:04,097 --> 00:00:06,297
(Leonard:)I wish there were more.

3
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:09,304
(Sheldon:)Good night.

4
00:00:16,143 --> 00:00:19,513
(Sheldon:)- I'm sorry, this is really important.
- What is it?

5
00:00:22,482 --> 00:00:24,002
(Sheldon:)I like the Transformers.

6
00:00:26,053 --> 00:00:29,023
(Sheldon:)Do you like the Transformers?

7
00:00:29,623 --> 00:00:32,653
(Leonard:)Where exactly did your mother
have you tested?

8
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,620
(Bernadette:)Leonard.

9
00:00:35,062 --> 00:00:40,402
(Sheldon:)The Transformers teach us that things
are not always what they appear to be.

10
00:00:40,567 --> 00:00:41,967
You know, like a...

11
00:00:42,135 --> 00:00:45,465
A semi-truck might be an alien robot...

12
00:00:45,639 --> 00:00:49,239
(Sheldon:)...or, uh, someone
in a romantic relationship...

13
00:00:49,443 --> 00:00:52,343
(Sheldon:)...might feel differently
than they appear to.

14
00:00:52,512 --> 00:00:56,172
(Sheldon:)Or a conversation
about the Transformers...

15
00:00:56,350 --> 00:01:05,020
(Sheldon:)...might actually be about someone
in this room.

